      "body": "Reconciles the retained Williamson County Census snapshot (GEOID 48491) with two independent October 25 captures. Stacked onto #500; exactly ten changed files.\n\nThree inserted ring vertices (1,628 → 1,631) preserve every original vertex. AREALAND changes 2,890,090,365 → 2,890,092,199 m² (+1,834); AREAWATER changes 41,474,365 → 41,472,527 m² (−1,838); combined −4 m². Other stable attributes match. Cause remains unverified; no legal boundary or reclassification conclusion is inferred.\n\nOriginal raw/canonical bytes are archived. Both independent captures match the candidate byte for byte; strict snapshot comparison passes. Exact insertion evidence and regression coverage are included. Census attribution/date only is refreshed; precinct dates, strict comparators and governance holds remain intact.\n\nValidation: 263 local tests passed; 33 normalized datasets validated; GeoJSON joins, raw/canonical support, archived-byte preservation and diff checks passed. Uploaded tree matches the local reviewed tree exactly: 8fba3467f1cfdafe7cca695036d4f7f7486eca9c.\n\nUser approved this bounded draft upload including the geometry and area changes. GitHub CI is pending verification. Draft only: no merge, production promotion, manual workflow dispatch or governance closure.",
